  "body": "2.5491 hectares (approx. 6.3 acres) of land with breathtaking, panoramic sea views looking across the Hauraki Gulf to Rangitoto. This site has the newly completed Glenvar Ridge Road cutting through, making subdivision and development accessible and easy. All major services like wastewater, power, gas, and town water supply are along the road.\r\n\r\nThe majority of this superb land is zoned for residential Single House under the Auckland Unitary Plan and has huge potential for subdivisions (600m² per site, council consent required).\r\n\r\nMinutes away is the Long Bay development area. The entire development contains over 160ha and will produce approximately 2,000 dwellings. Site work has commenced and the sections have been sold fast. The Long Bay village, less than one kilometre away, is anticipated to include 7,634m² of commercial area, eateries, retail, a supermarket and more. In clear view is Long Bay Regional Park. The park, marine reserve, and protected heritage zone is renowned for its beauty, walks, recreation and scenery.\r\n\r\nZoned for decile 10 schools, Long Bay Primary and Long Bay College. Only a five to 10 minute drive to Albany and a 25 minute drive to downtown Auckland (off-peak).\r\n\r\nSubdivide and cash in or landbank for the future.",
